Perito --> CU_3_02_03
Perito --> CU_3_02_04

Perito --> CU_3_03_01
Perito --> CU_3_03_02
Perito --> CU_3_03_03
Perito --> CU_3_03_04

Coordinador --> CU_3_01_03
Coordinador --> CU_3_01_04
